[[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Disconnect electrical connections (1a), (1b), (1c).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Switch on boot outer handle</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2428459\">I33A</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Switch on boot outer handle</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2428460\">I33B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1c</p></td><td><p>Left number plate light</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2428392\">F50</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1d</p></td><td><p>Right number plate lgiht</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2428394\">F51</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Unscrew the nuts.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2045176.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,1,0,"<p>1. Working from the outside of the tailgate, remove the handle.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2045177.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,1,0,"<p><a href=\"#/2429406\">5540A94</a>\n                                           (left and right sides),\nif necessary.</p><p><a href=\"#/2429406\">5540A94</a>\n                                           (left\nand right sides), if necessary.</p><p><a href=\"#/2429539\">7015B48</a>\n                                           (centre\nand left), if necessary.</p>"],[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the handle assembly\nis not damaged.</p><p><a href=\"#/2429539\">7015B48</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429406\">5540A94</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429406\">5540A94</a></p><p>Position the handle and secure it using\nthe nuts.</p><p>Connect the electrical connections .</p>"]]